{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_broca_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_broca_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"愤怒的布洛卡","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_broca_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"470d984b7de0546db987638231cf63b9a5032042b7b78870862453149cfb634c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奥斯塔，最近有什么好玩的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不对，奥斯塔出外勤去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好无聊啊，就不能忽然发生点什么有趣的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，布洛卡，有没有什么想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......布洛卡，今天星期几？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星期二。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吃完了，先回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，布洛卡这几天果然有问题啊，毕竟今天是星期三。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙肯定有事瞒着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，刚才还说无聊呢，事儿这不就来了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该去看看布洛卡在干什么了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，直接去找他，他肯定不会告诉我，这种时候就该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，有了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"和大部分干员的房间相比，布洛卡的房间并不算整洁。\n倒不是说他的房间有多杂乱，而是房间里的东西实在不算少，地上、桌上，甚至床上都摆着各种零件、图纸和工具。\n与其说是宿舍，不如说是一个小型的工作室。\n而最显眼的，是房间角落的那座工具台。\n来到罗德岛后，他的手艺逐渐得到了认可，工程部也十分欢迎他的到来，并在工坊内为他准备了一块区域，作为他的专属工作区。\n然而，他却拒绝了工坊的优渥条件，并表示希望在自己的房间里进行工作。\n工程部同意了他的请求，在为他专门购置了一座工具台之余，还对房间进行了隔音处理。\n往常，回到房间的布洛卡会立刻投入到制作工作中。\n但今天，他却并没有这样做，而是坐在椅子上，环视了一圈桌子周围。\n桌子周围贴满了设计图，而图纸上画的都是他的那把多功能电钻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉，这些设计都有点无法割舍啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不过，今天又有一些新想法，再出几个版本看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，开工——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯提示音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"干员布洛卡，工程部发来联络，希望你立刻前往工程部一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程部......？难道是我之前问的材料有着落了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看一眼吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，果然把他骗走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候，要是奥斯塔在，肯定要感慨，布洛卡还是这么单纯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，就让这家伙永远单纯下去也没什么不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，趁他还没回来，让我来看一看，布洛卡到底瞒着我在干什么吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这些设计图是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个可以伸缩的钻头有点意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过——我觉得还是这个比较好，内置音响，可以放点重金属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*叙拉古赞美词*，这个好啊！可以从电钻形态变成电锯形态！这不是我们之前一起打的那个游戏里的武器吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回来啦，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些设计图不是挺好的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有创意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你这几天把自己关在房间里是在背着兄弟干什么见不得人的事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没有特意想瞒着你，只是最近有了很多新的改造想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把电钻一路跟着我从叙拉古来到这里，它就跟我的另一条手臂一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在想把它改造一下，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么不能跟我说的？难道说，兄弟就不是你的手臂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上厕所时需要兄弟帮忙扶着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你喊我的话，我肯定可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还别说，我还真想过，等我们以后七老八十了，就互相——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*很难听的叙拉古俚语*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关键是，这些都是我自己改着玩的东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从一开始就没打算给别人看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也没什么关系吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我们不是无话不谈的兄弟吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无话不谈和这个是两码事！我想给你看的时候，会给你看的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！那我现在也已经看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，反正我已经看到了，干脆我也来一起帮忙改造你的电钻吧！奥斯塔没回来，我闲着也是闲着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，开门啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙怎么生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是不明白了，只是改造个电钻而已，有什么好藏着掖着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你不让我一起，我偏要一起。等着吧，布洛卡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":".................."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶啊，都怪贾维这个混蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一下搞得我根本静不下心来做新的设计！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如说，已经完全没兴致了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，出去散散心，找找灵感吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesgreenhouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"每当布洛卡感觉心神不宁的时候，他就会来调香师打理的疗养庭院坐一坐。\n刚一踏入庭院，沁人心脾的香气就扑面而来。\n他找了一个角落坐下，然后，开始尽情地呼吸甜美的空气。\n几个深呼吸后，他感觉自己的心情平静了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，如果电钻在转动的时候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，要不然，我们给电钻加上能够释放香氛的功能吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么又来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你往这边走，就跟过来了呗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起这个，我们刚才想到一块儿去了，对吧，兄弟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你刚才绝对提到了电钻吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，而且我们可是兄弟，我太了解你了，这种时候，我们想到的东西绝对是一样的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算它刚才是，现在它也不是了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为啥？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们想的一样，而且，它被你抢先说出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？兄弟，我们一起改造了这么多的东西，我怎么不知道，你还有这种洁癖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不一样，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己决定要改造的东西，所以，这不一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你倒是说清楚，到底什么地方不一样啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"甲板上的风很大，虽然能隐约看到远处有几个干员，但大体上，可以用“没人”来概括这里的情况。\n和部分干员一样，布洛卡喜欢挑这种时候来到这里。\n仅仅只是为了享受这种空旷的孤独感。\n当然，今天的他还有一个目的。\n他换了十几条通道，特意走错了八道闸门，分别在六个活动室逗留了一会儿，最终才来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但愿贾维那家伙不会找过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"布洛卡来到栏杆边，感受强风刮过自己发梢的撕扯感，放空了自己的大脑。\n他决定什么都不再去想，就在这里发呆到吃晚饭的时候。\n到那时，贾维应该也消停了。\n然而，事与愿违。\n有只手敲了敲他的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，贾维。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在他身后，贾维站在那里，手中拿着几张设计图。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，我想了想，确实，既然你已经做了那么多设计，我也该拿出我的设计才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我刚才去画了几张，你要不要看一看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，兄弟，你没明白，我需要的不是这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你需要的到底是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么都不要，我就是想一个人搞点对这把电钻的改造，要是有时间的话，顺便实现一些创意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，所以我不明白的就是——为啥你非得一个人搞这个呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为——啧，我该怎么跟你说呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么想就怎么说呗，我又不可能会嘲笑你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这个问题，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些想法我就是说不出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不说的话，我不知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你是我兄弟，我绝对现在就把你丢下甲板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......因为我觉得这些创意本身都没有什么了不起的，就跟小时候随便涂涂画画一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们没必要让别人知道，我一个人搞着玩就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，现在你知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞了半天，原来是这样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你一直对自己没自信，所以，会有这种想法也不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我觉得吧，你来到罗德岛也挺久了，你的手艺大家都看在眼里，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你也要对自己有信心才行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倒也不是这么一回事。不过，你这家伙难得说点人话，还是谢谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没说完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我觉得你那些创意都很有趣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我决定了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去把你那些创意拿给工程部的大伙瞧瞧，要是他们都认可你了，你也就不会自卑了吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等，不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维，你给我站住，我要杀了你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，来晚了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工具台上，原本贴在那里的几张设计图已经不翼而飞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，我明天就去申请换门锁，不能再把我房间的备用门卡给贾维了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会去哪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，对了，气糊涂了，工程部，对，工程部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——这次外勤终于结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总算可以放松一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维好像有什么东西要在工程部发表，正在招呼人过去看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火神大姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"火神","speakerId":"avg_163_hpsts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你这小子一出现，准没好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我这次可是带来了许多有趣的设计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这些设计——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，布洛卡，你小子也太害羞了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根本不是你想的那样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，别装了，我已经完全理解你的想法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*叙拉古俚语*，你能理解就见鬼了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，今天我非要让大家看看你的设计不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想都别想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维&布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说贾维要发表什么东西，就想着过来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么感觉你们俩要打起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维&布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听我说，布洛卡/贾维这家伙他——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，事情我已经明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你说说，是谁有道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，你先说，你打算怎么办吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经想明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想了结这件事，我必须把你打趴下，让你在床上躺个三天左右才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，胆子变大了啊，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我胆子变大了，是你逼我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己在说什么，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是认真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，气死我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，我最近应该没有做什么让布洛卡不爽的事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是不是不想和我们当兄弟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，罗德岛上确实有很多有趣的家伙，他要是有单飞的想法，我应该祝福他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了不是这么一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一路从叙拉古走到今天，我不允许我们的团队就这样解散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论他有什么想法，他都必须先战胜我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我——绝对会拿出我的全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧，奥斯塔？你干嘛用这种眼神看我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，这么多年过去了，你和布洛卡真是一点都没变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。对了，贾维。今天中午有你最爱的千层面，你不多吃点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再去给你多打几杯饮料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，好！吃饱喝足了才有力气修理布洛卡那家伙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饭吃饱了吧，布洛卡？今天我可不会手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不会留手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在反悔还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，贾维，这一架我非打不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为不这样的话，你永远都不会放弃来帮我，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"废话，你和奥斯塔是我最好的兄弟，我当然不能放着你们不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你已经不需要我的帮助了吗？你不需要兄弟了，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我当然也把你和奥斯塔当成最好的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还把我和奥斯塔当作兄弟，那就应该拉上我们两个一起解决问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的奥斯塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别算上我......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这和是不是兄弟压根没有关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是兄弟，和我想自己解决问题没有矛盾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，真是顽固！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顽固的是你，贾维！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我只能用我的拳头和扳手让你想起来，我们贾维团伙的三兄弟是密不可分的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也只能用我的拳头和钻头告诉你，最好的兄弟也是需要有一些自己的空间的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不需要那种东西，你这混账——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我需要啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，我的肚子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......我的肚子，好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你算计我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，贾维。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，贾维还在生气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都这么说了，他当然会生气吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还问我，自己最近是不是哪里得罪你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道他是真心想帮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就是这样的人，把自己的一切都毫无保留地展现给身边的人，永远不会理解，有的人是需要一些私人空间的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的解释他听得进去，他就不叫贾维了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说的也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"avg_356_broca_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想请你帮我个忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工程部的一角，贾维虚弱地躺在长椅上，捂着肚子看着天花板，给人感觉他正经历着前所未有的迷茫。\n奥斯塔则拿着一个袋子坐在他的旁边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡去医疗部给你开了点胃药，吃下这个，明天应该就能好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，我还是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，就算是最好的兄弟，彼此也不能做到毫无保留吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟、情侣、家族，有太多存在于这些关系中的秘密了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的时候，连我们自己都无法做到对自己毫无保留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放眼这片大地，恐怕也只有你会问这种问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也有事瞒着我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我该怎么办？难道我必须接受这件事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处，布洛卡站在工程部某个工坊的门口，他已经准备就绪。\n但他还是担忧地望向了奥斯塔和贾维这边，奥斯塔对他点了点头，示意他放心。\n布洛卡松了口气，终于下定决心，带着已经准备好的材料和自己的电钻走进工坊之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，有的时候，我们只需要等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，用笑容去迎接我们最好的兄弟凯旋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
